1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,948
This is Team Activation Lab, an independent concept I built for the B2B Growth P M role.

2
00:00:06,948 --> 00:00:12,006
It uses synthetic data, and it is not an official TryHackMe tool.

3
00:00:12,457 --> 00:00:18,932
A company tries cyber training, but signing up does not mean the team gets useful practice.

4
00:00:18,932 --> 00:00:21,565
So first, the manager picks one goal.

5
00:00:22,015 --> 00:00:30,810
The goal becomes a seven day proof plan. Creating it logs a plan event, locally, in the same schema the growth view reads.

6
00:00:31,261 --> 00:00:36,176
Now invite two learners. These invitations are simulated.

7
00:00:36,176 --> 00:00:40,057
Nothing is sent. They are local records only.

8
00:00:40,508 --> 00:00:45,859
I simulate each learner accepting, starting, and completing a meaningful lab.

9
00:00:45,859 --> 00:00:52,391
The first value check turns green when two distinct invited learners finish within seven days.

10
00:00:58,625 --> 00:01:08,104
Second half. Is this journey worth shipping? The growth view loads a seeded pilot of three hundred accounts, and validates every row.

11
00:01:08,104 --> 00:01:13,307
Malformed rows are quarantined with a reason, and duplicates are dropped.

12
00:01:13,758 --> 00:01:17,345
Before any outcome appears, I register the contract.

13
00:01:17,345 --> 00:01:26,175
The unit is the account, assigned by a seeded hash, with an intent to treat denominator, a minimum sample, and a minimum effect.

14
00:01:26,627 --> 00:01:32,711
The funnel shows every step with its denominator, so you can see exactly who was counted.

15
00:01:33,161 --> 00:01:40,110
Results are absolute rates with ninety five percent intervals, and the percentage point difference.

16
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:44,603
All quality gates pass, so the verdict is ship to a wider pilot.

17
00:01:45,054 --> 00:01:54,940
Now the failure case. This file has duplicate events, a variant logging bug, unbalanced groups, and only three days of observation.

18
00:01:55,393 --> 00:02:01,725
Treatment even looks better here. But the gates fail, so the lab refuses to call a winner.

19
00:02:01,725 --> 00:02:03,625
The verdict is no decision.

20
00:02:08,567 --> 00:02:16,191
Every verdict exports as a decision record, with the evidence, the failed checks, and the limitations.

21
00:02:16,191 --> 00:02:20,451
It is fake data, but a real product and measurement loop.

22
00:02:20,451 --> 00:02:22,918
Independent concept by Ayo Ahmed.

